    {
      "id": "story_navigation",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "steps": [
          {
            "step": 0,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=0&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nA working contract is only the beginning\n×\nA working contract is only the beginning\nLEVEL 201 CONNECTED A VM TO AI. LEVEL 301 GOVERNS WHETHER ITS EVIDENCE MAY BE REVIEWED.\n00 · 1/2"
          },
          {
            "step": 1,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=0&scene=1",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nTHE OPERATIONAL GAP\nReachable does not mean governed\nThe request returned\n→\nThe caller, path, placement, and record agree\n\nA mismatch must REFUSE. Missing evidence must ABSTAIN. ALLOW_REVIEW still requires a human.\n\n00 · 2/2"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=1&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nDECLARE BEFORE OBSERVE\nReveal one control boundary at a time\n\nEvery question compares declared intent with an independent observation.\n\n1\nIdentity\n2\nNetwork\n3\nPlacement\n4\nObservability\n5\nHuman authority\nAUDIENCE QUESTION\nWhich workload is asking?\nReveal technical boundary\nactive request and evidence path\ndeployment or trust boundary\noptional integration\nVIRTUAL-MACHINE\nVM client\ndeclared identity + correlation ID\nOPENSHIFT NAMESPACE\nnamespaced development candidate\nHTTP JSON\n→\nSERVICE\nGoverned adapter Service\ndeclared destination only\n:8080\nadmit / refuse\n→\nPOLICY\nNetworkPolicy\ndefault deny + labeled exception\nevaluate\n→\nDEPLOYMENT\nDecision adapter\nordered deterministic checks\nPOST /api/v1/modernize\ncompare\n→\nEVIDENCE\nIdentity observations\nnamespace · VM · VMI UID · service account\ncompare\n→\nEVIDENCE\nPlacement observations\nnode · architecture · required labels\nexport\n→\nDATA\nCorrelated record\nchecks · reasons · state · timestamp\naccept / reject\n→\nAUTHORITY\nHuman reviewer\nonly "
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=2&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\n1\nComplete representative evidence\n2\nIdentity mismatch\n3\nPlacement observation missing\nGOVERNED REHEARSAL\nStart with the declared request\nCompare declared intent with identity, path, placement, and correlation evidence.\nINPUT\nGovernance evidence request\nOne typed request exercises complete, mismatched, and unknown evidence without changing a workload.\nInspect technical topology\nRun governed conditions\nAUTHORITY\nOutcome remains human-owned\n\nEach condition retains its source state and ordered reason. A later result never erases an earlier refusal.\n\nALLOW_REVIEW permits inspection; it never deploys, migrates, promotes, or certifies.\n02 · 1/2"
          },
          {
            "condition_result": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\n1\nComplete representative evidence\n2\nIdentity mismatch\n3\nPlacement observation missing\nCONDITION 1 OF 3\nComplete representative evidence\nEvery deterministic check passes; fixture output permits review but claims no live AI.\nREHEARSAL\nOUTCOME\nALLOW_REVIEW\nREASON\nCONTROLS_COMPLETE\nAUTHORITY\nHUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED\n\nLive endpoint returned HTTP 404 Showing clearly labeled fallback evidence.\n\nInspect technical topology\nNext governed condition →\nAUTHORITY\nOutcome remains human-owned\n\nEach condition retains its source state and ordered reason. A later result never erases an earlier refusal.\n\nALLOW_REVIEW permits inspection; it never deploys, migrates, promotes, or certifies.\n02 · 1/2"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=2&scene=1",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nThe outcome follows evidence quality\nCOMPLETE\nALLOW_REVIEW\n\nEvidence may be reviewed; no operational action is authorized.\n\nMISMATCH\nREFUSE\n\nKnown unsafe identity, network, or placement disagreement.\n\nUNKNOWN\nABSTAIN\n\nMissing correlation, placement, or model evidence.\n\n02 · 2/2"
          },
          {
            "step": 5,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=3&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nMECHANISMS\nPolicy is observable and ordered\n\nThese controls make the result repeatable without granting automation authority.\n\n01\nRefusal precedence\nIdentity and network decide before model use.\nUnsafe callers and paths never become prompts.\n02\nOne evidence key\nEvery check retains one correlation identifier.\nA missing join becomes an abstention, not a guessed record.\n03\nObserved placement\nRequired labels must be present in evidence.\nREHEARSAL labels exercise logic; only target receipts support hardware claims.\n03 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 6,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=4&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nWHAT THIS SESSION ESTABLISHED\nA decision record with an honest limit\nREHEARSAL\n1 proof condition completed\nLATEST OUTCOME\nALLOW_REVIEW\nORDERED REASON\nCONTROLS_COMPLETE\nAUTHORITY\nHUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED\nThe same contract allowed review, refused a mismatch, and abstained on absence.\nLaunchpad still owns live execution, measurement, cleanup, certification, and promotion.\nClose the story and build the controls in the separate Showroom lab →\n04 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 7,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-301-67141888/proxy/tool/story/?act=4&scene=0&finale=1",
